339
00:20:04,645 --> 00:20:08,501
When it is missing, fall back to the title attribute if present,

340
00:20:08,501 --> 00:20:11,394
and log a development-mode warning that names the icon,

341
00:20:11,394 --> 00:20:13,643
so teams can find each call site.

342
00:20:13,643 --> 00:20:16,215
Mark the old behaviour deprecated in the changelog.

343
00:20:17,590 --> 00:20:18,737
A11Y-001 · 4.

344
00:20:18,737 --> 00:20:22,946
