345
00:20:24,071 --> 00:20:28,612
Provide a migration: an ng update schematic that rewrites title="..." to label="...",

346
00:20:28,612 --> 00:20:32,774
and reports call sites with neither for a person to fix.

347
00:20:34,150 --> 00:20:35,379
