00:28:41,768 --> 00:28:42,617
Design notes:

480
00:28:43,992 --> 00:28:47,706
A11Y-002 · Fix: use the native <dialog> element

481
00:28:48,831 --> 00:28:51,673
The model stays the single source of truth.

482
00:28:51,673 --> 00:28:55,937
Escape is cancelled and turned into open.set(false), and the effect calls close().

483
00:28:55,937 --> 00:28:58,780
Focus restoration happens in the close event handler,

484
00:28:58,780 --> 00:29:03,044
so it runs for every way of closing. - afterRenderEffect is used

485
00:29:03,044 --> 00:29:07,308
because showModal() needs the element to be rendered; it never runs during

486
00:29:07,308 --> 00:29:08,019
server rendering.

487
00:29:08,019 --> 00:29:11,928
The close label is an input so applications can translate it.

488
00:29:11,928 --> 00:29:15,837
The page backdrop is now the ::backdrop pseudo-element, styled with tokens.

489
00:29:17,212 --> 00:29:18,365
