737
00:44:59,440 --> 00:45:00,581
A11Y-004 · 1.

738
00:45:00,581 --> 00:45:02,863
The input has no accessible name

739
00:45:03,988 --> 00:45:07,972
The label is a <span>, not a <label> associated with the input,

740
00:45:07,972 --> 00:45:11,625
so the input is announced as "edit text" with no name.

741
00:45:11,625 --> 00:45:14,613
Clicking the label text also does not focus the

742
00:45:14,613 --> 00:45:17,269
input, which matters for users with motor impairments.

743
00:45:18,645 --> 00:45:19,971
A11Y-004 · 1.

744
00:45:19,971 --> 00:45:22,625
The input has no accessible name

745
00:45:23,750 --> 00:45:27,730
