746
00:45:29,105 --> 00:45:30,415
A11Y-004 · 2.

747
00:45:30,415 --> 00:45:32,599
The hint is a placeholder

748
00:45:33,724 --> 00:45:36,867
Placeholder text disappears as soon as the user types,

749
00:45:36,867 --> 00:45:40,710
