750
00:45:40,710 --> 00:45:41,059
description.

751
00:45:41,059 --> 00:45:45,950
Users with memory or cognitive impairments lose the instruction exactly when they need it.

752
00:45:47,325 --> 00:45:48,606
A11Y-004 · 2.

753
00:45:48,606 --> 00:45:50,741
The hint is a placeholder

754
00:45:51,867 --> 00:45:56,650
