755
00:45:58,025 --> 00:45:59,250
A11Y-004 · 3.

756
00:45:59,250 --> 00:46:00,884
Errors are visual only

757
00:46:02,009 --> 00:46:03,914
A red border is not announced,

758
00:46:03,914 --> 00:46:06,454
and the error text is not connected to

759
00:46:06,454 --> 00:46:07,089
the input.

760
00:46:07,089 --> 00:46:09,629
A screen-reader user hears nothing about the error,

761
00:46:09,629 --> 00:46:12,170
now or when they return to the field.

762
00:46:13,545 --> 00:46:15,195
A11Y-004 · 3.

