766
00:46:21,471 --> 00:46:23,000
Errors are visual only

767
00:46:24,125 --> 00:46:27,113
aria-invalid="true" on the input while there is an error.

768
00:46:27,113 --> 00:46:29,105
Add the error's id to aria-describedby,

769
00:46:29,105 --> 00:46:31,761
so it is read when the field gets

770
00:46:31,761 --> 00:46:32,093
