776
00:46:51,065 --> 00:46:52,378
A11Y-004 · 4.

777
00:46:52,378 --> 00:46:54,129
Required is visual only

778
00:46:55,254 --> 00:46:58,731
The asterisk is read as "star" (or not at all),

779
00:46:58,731 --> 00:47:01,861
and the input does not say it is required.

780
00:47:01,861 --> 00:47:04,990
Use the required attribute (or aria-required="true" if native validation

781
00:47:04,990 --> 00:47:08,120
is unwanted) and hide the asterisk from assistive technology.

782
00:47:08,120 --> 00:47:11,250
