783
00:47:12,625 --> 00:47:13,948
A11Y-004 · 5.

784
00:47:13,948 --> 00:47:16,596
Ids must be unique per instance

785
00:47:17,721 --> 00:47:20,041
A sign-up form has many fields.

786
00:47:20,041 --> 00:47:22,748
Every id the component generates (input, hint,

787
00:47:22,748 --> 00:47:27,002
error) must be unique per instance, or for and aria-describedby point

788
00:47:27,002 --> 00:47:28,549
at the wrong field.

