A11Y-005 · 1.

895
00:54:28,091 --> 00:54:31,750
"Sometimes hear nothing": live regions created with their content

896
00:54:32,876 --> 00:54:36,760
Each toast element is created already containing role="alert" and its text.

897
00:54:36,760 --> 00:54:40,645
