01:15:24,801 --> 01:15:28,036
How would you extend this to multiple selection?

1251
01:15:28,036 --> 01:15:30,867
What changes in ARIA and keyboard behaviour?

1252
01:15:36,170 --> 01:15:41,861
Represent selection as a collection, add aria-multiselectable true, and expose aria-selected for each option.

1253
01:15:41,861 --> 01:15:44,301
Choose an APG-supported multiple-selection keyboard model.

1254
01:15:44,301 --> 01:15:47,553
In a modifier-free model, Space toggles the active

1255
01:15:47,553 --> 01:15:50,806
option, with optional range and select-all behavior documented.

1256
01:15:50,806 --> 01:15:55,685
Keep focus independent of selection so navigation does not unexpectedly clear choices.

1257
01:15:55,685 --> 01:15:59,750
Define disabled behavior, output payloads, and reconciliation when options disappear.

1258
01:15:59,750 --> 01:16:05,036
This is a new public contract, not just changing value to an array.

