1278
01:17:26,343 --> 01:17:29,654
Use an overlay strategy for positioning and outside interaction.

1279
01:17:29,654 --> 01:17:34,069
Keep the standalone listbox's selection logic reusable, but do not assume adding

1280
01:17:34,069 --> 01:17:38,117
